// X1 part 2c moved the masks baked for 10° to 80° to a + 16°·sin(2a) (the file names keep the
// baked angles), so the face holds its light longer as the key turns from the front, as the
// reference games' faces do: a light 45° to the side shades only the far cheek's edge, and
// the shadow sweeps to the nose as the light comes side-on at 90°. Re-baking resets them.
